===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|sv|gmq-osw|troa|trōa}}, {{m|gmq-osw|tro|trōa}}, from {{inh|sv|non|trúa}}, from {{inh|sv|gem-pro|*trūwāną}}.

====Verb====
{{sv-verb-reg|tro|r|dde}}

# to [[believe]], (in the sense of "to believe") to [[think]] (think that something is true or real (without being perfectly certain))
#: {{ux|sv|Jag '''tror''' han skulle komma vid sextiden|I '''think''' he was going to come around six o'clock}}
#: {{ux|sv|Hon '''trodde''' att Oslo var Danmarks huvudstad|She '''thought''' that Oslo was the capital of Denmark}}
#: {{ux|sv|Hon '''tror''' fortfarande på tomten|She still '''believes''' in Santa Claus}}
#: {{ux|sv|Det har '''trotts''' mycket kring den här utvecklingen, men det har inte varit fastslaget i data vad som verkligen håller på att ske – förrän nu.|Much has been '''speculated''' ("believed") concerning this development, but it hasn't been proven by data what really is happening – until now.}}
#: {{ux|sv|'''tro''' alla om gott|'''think''' well of everybody}}
#: {{ux|sv|'''tro''' något om någon|'''believe''' something of someone}}
# to [[believe]], to [[trust]] (someone) (think that they are telling the truth)
#* {{quote-song|sv|author=Di Leva|year=1987|album=Vem ska jag tro på?|title=Vem ska jag '''tro på'''?|trans-title=Who should I '''trust'''?|text=Vem ska jag '''tro på''', '''tro på''', '''tro på''' när, '''tro på''' när allt är så här?|t=Who should I '''trust''', '''trust''', '''trust''' when, '''trust''' when everything's like this?}}
#: {{ux|sv|Jag '''tror''' dig|I '''believe''' you}}
#: {{ux|sv|Jag '''tror''' dig inte|I don't '''believe''' you}}
# to [[believe]] (in) (think that someone or something will or has the capacity to do well or turn out well)
#* {{quote-song|sv|author=Uno Svenningsson|artist=Uno Svenningsson, Eva Dahlgren|year=1994|album=Uno|title='''Tro''' På Varann|trans-title='''Believe''' In Each Other|text=Du. Jag vill att vi '''tror''' på varann.|t=You [or "Hey," as a kind of vocative]. I want us to '''believe''' in each other.}}
#: {{ux|sv|'''tro''' på någon|'''believe in''' someone}}
#: {{ux|sv|'''tro''' på framtiden|'''have faith''' in the future}}
# to have [[religious]] [[faith]]
#: {{ux|sv|Tvivla inte utan '''tro'''!|Doubt not, '''believe'''!}}
#: {{ux|sv|'''Tror''' du på Gud?|Do you '''believe''' in God?}}

